<h2>1. Our Purpose</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>The Mission:</strong> Providing urgent, free, or low-cost home repairs for residents in Buncombe and Madison counties affected by Hurricane Helene.</li>
<li><strong>The Problem:</strong> Streamlining repairs for low-income, uninsured, or underinsured homeowners.</li>
<li><strong>The Solution:</strong> A centralized online database (the "Marketplace") and a joint application process.</li>
<li><strong>The Branding Goal:</strong> Ensure visual consistency across the digital "Marketplace" so subcontractors and volunteers can navigate the system efficiently.</li>
