<h3>3b. Role Identity System</h3>
<p>The ARCHR system uses color to create unique "Visual Workspaces." Each role is defined by a primary <strong>Action Color</strong> (and, in roadmapped UI, a corresponding Soft Background Tint) to improve navigation and task focus.</p>
